 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? Great hobby. There are three main ways to get your show out into the world. You can host it yourself, use a platform, or get a co-host. Then a niche feed is key. Pick one platform and stick to it. People find shows by searching for themes, not names. Not for hosting, but for editing. A good audio editor is worth its weight in gold. Great. Start with few episodes of a co-host and see where it goes. A single host can feel lonely.",
